  "limitations": [
    "Only one nominal 1 mL syringe and one fixed tip family are carried by this arm; no 10 mL syringe or automatic tool changer.",
    "All added mechanical dimensions, spindle lead, hose and connector details are design assumptions.",
    "The perfusor analogy describes motor-driven piston translation; the syringe moves air rather than directly infusing liquid.",
    "Screw rotation and carriage translation are source-coupled, but no torque, backlash, motor steps, sensors or real dose are qualified.",
    "Arm source geometry and cameras are referenced unchanged; mounting contacts are provisional clamp envelopes.",
    "Hose shapes are checked static routes of constant modeled length, not a dynamic hose, full-range routing, torsion, fatigue or pinch proof.",
    "No timed robot transport, runtime sample ledger, device firmware, medical use or hardware execution is introduced.",
    "The jointwise inspection window is a tooling-use assumption for named static builds, not a collision-free Cartesian product or a hardware controller limit. Other combinations require separate routing and collision checks.",
    "Only named source configurations are supported static snapshots. Cartesian corner/edge trials are diagnostics; unsupported trials remain explicitly classified and are not available motions or verified operating states."
  ],
